version 4.6
game MW

ui_text This script makes specific Challenge Series events compatible with Bartender.
ui_text
ui_text This script assumes your game's Challenge Series events have their vanilla
ui_text settings. You're free to change the values of any parameters this scripts adds
ui_text to event nodes, except for the "UseWorldHeat" parameter (which must be "True").
ui_text
ui_text This script is necessary because Bartender's "Advanced" feature set removes
ui_text the hard-coded Heat behaviour a select few Challenge Series events rely on
ui_text to choose their Heat-level limits. We need to add a few missing parameters
ui_text to the nodes of these events so that they work as intended when Bartender
ui_text makes the game read the "ForceHeatLevel" and "MaxHeatLevel" parameters for
ui_text all Challenge Series events instead; luckily, only two events are affected.
ui_text
ui_text You can safely ignore any "add_field"-related errors this script might cause.

add_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking ForceHeatLevel
update_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking ForceHeatLevel 5

add_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking UseWorldHeat
update_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_burgerking UseWorldHeat True

add_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_tollbooth_03 MaxHeatLevel
update_field gameplay race_bin_challenge_tollbooth/challenge_tollbooth_03 MaxHeatLevel 5